==Strategy==
Since the stage relies on the pushing power of the Sir Rels to be threatening, units that can shut down the pushing power of these rabid squirrels can help greatly. One such example is [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]], whose surge will slow any enemy caught in it and completely nullify its pushing power. Once the Sir Rels are properly dealt with, the rest of the stage won't be an issue.

